            "url": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g189113-d315084-r728523175-Quinta_Das_Figueirinhas_Quintinha_Village-Armacao_de_Pera_Faro_District_Algarve.html?m=63520#review728523175",
            "trip_type": "Family",
            "travel_date": "2019-10",
            "text": "We visited here as a family in October. I can honestly say I’ve never had a more relaxing break. The hotel is absolutely spotless and all the staff are very helpful. We loved spending lazy days at the pool, at the beach or exploring the town. The hotel put on a free shuttle bus to the resort centre and arrange a time to pick you up. If you are looking for a relaxing break I thoroughly recommend this resort. I hope to return here in the future.",
            "user": {
                "username": "MrsLMcG18",
                "user_location": {
                    "name": null,
                    "id": null
                }
            },
            "title": "Relaxing",
            "owner_response": null,
            "subratings": []
        },
        {
            "id": "717893755",
            "lang": "en",
            "location_id": "315084",
            "published_date": "2019-10-13T03:05:30-0400",
            "rating": 4,
            "helpful_votes": "0",
            "rating_image_url": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/s4.0-63520-5.svg",
            "url": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g189113-d315084-r717893755-Quinta_Das_Figueirinhas_Quintinha_Village-Armacao_de_Pera_Faro_District_Algarve.html?m=63520#review717893755",
            "trip_type": null,
            "travel_date": "2019-10",
            "text": "Just got back from a weeks holiday here with our daughter of 25 years. The check in was quick and hassle free, and the reception spoke good English. Our room, number 23 was a duplex apartment with 2 bedrooms and quite spacious. There was a good sized fridge with small freezer compartment. There was a kettle, toaster, Iron, and TV with a lot of channels in various languages.  Unfortunately for my wife, there is no hair driers.The location of this complex was a little isolated, but only a 10 minute walk to the lovely beaches. The pool area was good, and very quiet ( I assume because of the time of year). It has a small shop by the pool, and  one  by reception. We hired a car for 3 days to get out and  about ( Autorocha car hire was our choice and a very good price).Do not use Europcar, they were not very helpfull and a lot dearer. We went on the tour of  Sir Cliff Richards vineyard about 13 kms away, which was quite good ( 10 euros each). Another day we went to Silvas town, again not too far away. This had a castle to walk around ( 2.80 euros each). There are several resataurants dotted around the area within walking distance ( see my other reviews for  a couple). Also there is Intermarche supermarket 10 minutes walk  away, which we used a lot.",
            "user": {
                "username": "markie42",
                "user_location": {
                    "name": "Littlehampton, United Kingdom",
                    "id": "504226"
                }
            },
            "title": "relaxing in  early October",
