            "trip_type": "Couples",
            "travel_date": "2019-09",
            "text": "We have just returned from our second visit to this complex.Accomodation spacious and extremely clean. Slightly dated. The pool area and gardens are lovely, with plenty of sunbeds at any time of day. In a great area with a few nice beaches within walking distance. There are also many restaurants nearby which are of excellent quality and value. Will definately return",
