            "trip_type": "Family",
            "travel_date": "2019-08",
            "text": "We chose here as it was a cheap family holiday, we expected cheap!! We were wrong!! It was fantastic, the apartment was big and clean. The pool was great, there were no idiots around causing lots of noise. It was very quiet and peaceful. There is a cafe, bar and  restaurant on site which was good food at a reasonable price. We are desperate to go back 👍🏼",
